    may be made of the Copernicus information or data it contains.

  * Sentinel-5P
    Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data.

  * MODIS
    Courtesy of NASA.


IMPORTANT — REDISTRIBUTION OF SOURCE DATA IS UNRESOLVED
-------------------------------------------------------

Two statements issued by the Ministry of Environment conflict on whether the
raw air quality observations may be redistributed. See docs/legal.md for the
full analysis. Until that is resolved, this repository publishes derived
products and the pipeline needed to regenerate them, rather than a wholesale
copy of the raw hourly records.


ATTRIBUTION
-----------

When using this project's derived data, please cite both this project and the
originating agency. There is no CITATION.cff and no DOI: this is a personal
side project, and PLAN.md records the decision not to make one. Linking to
the repository is enough.


VENDORED THIRD-PARTY DATA IN THE SOURCE TREE
--------------------------------------------

Moved here from LICENSE. GitHub's licence detector hashes that file whole, so
a third-party section appended after the MIT text made the repository report
`NOASSERTION` / "Other" instead of MIT — the grant was correct and unreadable.
LICENSE is now the MIT text and nothing else; this is the file about data.

The MIT grant in LICENSE covers this project's own source code. It does not
and cannot cover third-party data committed alongside it:

  * web/src/lib/taiwan.ts — county boundary coordinates derived from 內政部
    國土測繪中心 open data, used under the Open Government Data License,
    Taiwan, version 1.0, as recorded above.
